// Fall week 2, Workshop 1: User Story Mapping (#466, restructured in #485).
// A 50-minute session in four parts, named with their minute marks on the
// agenda slide: story maps (minute 1), three worked examples (minute 4),
// the same proposal mapped by an AI tool (minute 11), and the teams' own
// maps (minute 15), with a volunteer clinic at minute 30 and the wrap at
// minute 45. The talk slides' target times sum to 15:00, and each part's
