    <p>
      The tool re-planned what the app already did. The page says the
      project "involves enhancing Ephira's functionality", yet its skeleton
      and much of its Release 1 plan the passcode and biometric lock,
      logging a day, the calendar, the filter, and a first prediction. Its
      fertile window appears nowhere in the proposal; the team did later
      build an ovulation phase card labeled "Peak fertility", close to it.
