      Agree, yet the tool's walking skeleton, "Export and re-import an
      encrypted file", also re-plans the plain export the app already had:
      half of that card was done. Pregnancy is marked AI misreads, yet the
      human map demoted it too, to a caption line instead of a card.
    </p>
    <p>
